{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1360586-exalted-the-tomb-of-dreams","id":1360586,"title":"Exalted \"The Tomb of Dreams\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-12T14:09:10-08:00","id":1360586,"title":"Exalted \"The Tomb of Dreams\"","content":"Hello folks,<br /> <br /> We bring to you the first chapter of our Exalted mini-series \u201cThe Tomb of Dreams\u201d. We hope you enjoy!<br /> <br /> In the age of the Exalted, champions empowered by the highest of gods, one Circle of Solars created a cache of powerful magical tools and talismans, but they died when the First Age ended in blood and betrayal. Now the tenor of Creation\u2019s dreams has changed, as Solars have returned to Creation and our Circle reborn Solars are blessed or plagued with memories of their earlier lives; &quot;Here is your legacy\u201d they say, \u201ca cache of your treasures. Claim and retrieve your tools, and use them as you will. They are your birthright.&quot; Will our Solars be able to brave the unknown and retrieve these treasures?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-348-exalted-the-tomb-of-dreams-chapter-1/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/ep-logo/pbblog4577585/tomb_of_dreams_PB_1200x628.jpg?s=7d4557d1524893bb784e4379f926d77a&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-348-exalted-the-tomb-of-dreams-chapter-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> Exalted \"The Tomb of Dreams\" Chapter 1: The Wolf at the Water&rsquo;s Edge | Twin Cities by Night </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-348-exalted-the-tomb-of-dreams-chapter-1/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://twincitiebynight.podbean.com/e/episode-348-exalted-the-tomb-of-dreams-chapter-1/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> On a night that feels torn from someone else&rsquo;s memory, four newly Exalted Solars find themselves ankle-deep on a storm-wracked reef, the sea stretching into endless darkness behind them and a smoking volcano looming ahead. Moments ago, they were entering a forgotten cave in a distant forest, following dreams of First Age ruins and echoes of past lives&mdash;but now the world has skipped a chapter. As Caral Fire Orchid, Faka Kun, I Seleamu, and Vulfur struggle to make sense of how they arrived together-yet-separate in this impossible place, the island answers with a predator born of smoke, sorrow, and teeth. Their first steps into the Tomb of Dreams will test not just their power, but the fragile trust between strangers bound by destiny. About the Chronicle Exalted: The Tomb of Dreams is a high-fantasy actual play from Twin Cities by Night, set in the mythic, anime-tinted world of Exalted. A circle of Solar Exalted&mdash;played by Quin, Adam, Slavic, and Mitch&mdash;venture into visions, ruins, and half-remembered lives under the guidance of storyteller Becca. The game leans into cinematic combat, big emotions, and the weight of destiny, blending character-driven drama with over-the-top heroic action as the circle chases treasures, truths, and the lingering shadows of a forgotten age. \ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Hop into our Discord! Love the stories? Want to chat with the storyteller and players? Or maybe you're just looking for a place to geek out about tabletop roleplaying games? Whether you're a seasoned GM, a curious newbie, or just love hearing epic tales unfold, our community is the perfect place to hang out, ask questions, share your own adventures, and connect with fellow TTRPG fans. Come say hi&mdash;we&rsquo;d love to meet you! \ud83d\udc49 https://discord.gg/T9zeN9p Follow Us X: https://x.com/Twin_Cities_VtM Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/TwinCitiesByNight/ iTunes: https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by-night/id1246523585?mt=2 SoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/twin-cities-by-night YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBUyj7h-xIhwsM3kHK56SRA &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Exalted is published by Onyx Path Publishing (Licensed from White Wolf Publishing).<br /> <br /> If you would like to support the podcast stop by our Patreon<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TwinCitiesbyNight\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.patreon.com/TwinCitiesbyNight</a><br /> <br /> Come by and visit our Discord!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/T9zeN9p\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/T9zeN9p\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/T9zeN9p\" target=\"_blank\"> https://discord.gg/T9zeN9p </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Check us out on iTunes:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by-night/id1246523585?mt=2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by-night/id1246523585?mt=2\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by-night/id1246523585?mt=2\" target=\"_blank\"> https://itunes.apple.com/us/podcast/twin-cities-by-night/id1246523585?mt=2 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><